# Voice Invocations (iOS)

Voice Invocations is a Wearables-level stream and needs no DeviceSession or runtime camera/microphone permission. Retain the stream and listeners, register before `start(deviceIdentifier:)`, acknowledge every `LaunchApp` exactly once, and call `stop()` during cleanup. The feature is experimental.
